{"v":4,"catch":"跳躍。收集。生存。","desc":"Robo Hop 是一款節奏感極強的 3D 平台遊戲。在遊戲中，你將控制一個勇敢的小機器人，探索充滿岩漿坑、浮島和各種棘手障礙的絢麗世界。你需要不斷地跳躍、閃躲，收集發光的齒輪，同時與懸浮的敵人作戰。每一關都將考驗你的反應速度、時機把握和探索精神。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-05-07","genres":["街機","動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/553c469b266337db994808632f25381fd8aba2534094854864c19ea7b1ca5cad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8962760b002fc484df73c182d76b7b58a92edec641f965263eefad0a0f4b1120.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32684cc34b144f2d241ce67c76706cd7b8f714d6eda3d9b617be68f7d2e731bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d7f84555f73711de8f617c64233c34e67500e411e57e2d19077dcb3ea82ddc2f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d4c76498bd702308e88636702eaf0368d0e146465f30b1ae9f877650cf0cbfff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f15d515d27124b64e14027ccfde3267e09d47e8f9a49423e77689357c3d57dbd.jpg"],"titleId":"010054c027d42000","dlc":[]}